  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Repair of 200 flats and houses for returnees to Sarajevo. Houses are to be repaired according to a limited standard and through a mixture of self-help and contractor work. Caritas Sweden and Caritas Switzerland are partners in implementation with financial support from both countries.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Reparation av 200 l&#xE4;genheter och hus f&#xF6;r &#xE5;terv&#xE4;ndare till Sarajevo. I Sarajevo &#xE4;r detta det tredje projektet d&#xE4;r Caritas ger st&#xF6;d till sj&#xE4;lv-hj&#xE4;lpsreparationer f&#xF6;r bost&#xE4;der.</narrative>
